A regular hexagon with a side length of 2 units is inscribed in a circle. What is the radius of the circle?

[asy]
unitsize(1 cm);

pair A, B, C, D, E, F;
real r = 2*sqrt(3);

A = dir(30);
B = dir(90);
C = dir(150);
D = dir(210);
E = dir(270);
F = dir(330);

draw(circle((0,0),r));
draw(A--B--C--D--E--F--cycle);
[/asy]
